'''Queen Reika''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Update 9.0]] increases knockbacks and reduces TBA. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]] and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

